  "verdict": "revise",
  "issues": [
    "The analyst applied a division by 10 to batch B values assuming they are in µg/L, but the conversion from µg/L to ng/mL is 1:1 (1 µg/L = 1 ng/mL). This correction is not supported by the printed output and likely introduces a ten‑fold error in the mean estimate."
